### Near East Technology API — VS Code REST Client dosyası.
### php artisan serve --port=8000 çalışırken kullanın.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tolgaosman@sirket.com",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Katalog ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Kategori ağacı
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Depolar (detaylı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/detailed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stok matrisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/stock-matrix?search=sunucu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tedarikçiler
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tedarikçi karneleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/scorecards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Ürünler ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Ürün listesi (kritik stok filtresi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?stockStatus=kritik&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ürün detay geçmişi
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/prd-0001/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Stok hareketleri ────────────────────────────────────

### Stok girişi (idempotency-key ile — aynı key'le tekrar çalıştırınca aynı hareket döner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock/in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": "wh-1",
  "productId": "prd-0001",
  "quantity": 10,
  "idempotencyKey": "manual-test-in-1"
}

### Stok çıkışı — yetersiz stok senaryosu (422 bekleniyor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock/out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": "wh-1",
  "productId": "prd-0001",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "reason": "satis"
}

### Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWarehouseId": "wh-1",
  "targetWarehouseId": "wh-2",
  "productId": "prd-0001",
  "quantity": 2
}

### ── Satın alma ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Sipariş istatistikleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Taslak sipariş oluştur
# @name createPo
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "sup-1",
  "warehouseId": "wh-1",
  "expectedAt": "2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "items": [{ "productId": "prd-0001", "quantity": 20, "unitPrice": 1000 }]
}

###
@poId = {{createPo.response.body.id}}

### Gönder (draft -> ordered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{poId}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kısmen teslim al
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/{{poId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantities": { "prd-0001": 5 },
  "idempotencyKey": "manual-receive-1"
}

### İkmal önerileri
GET {{baseUrl}}/replenishment/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Dashboard / raporlar ────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard?range=son-3-ay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Takvim
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendar?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-08-31T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Yetki reddi senaryosu (depo rolüyle satın alma) ─────
# @name depoLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mustafa.haci@sirket.com", "password": "demo1234" }

###
@depoToken = {{depoLogin.response.body.token}}

### 403 FORBIDDEN bekleniyor
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{depoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
